  m_Text: "<b>LEGEND</b>\n\n<color=#D8D4CC>\u25A0</color>  Thoroughfares\n<color=#B0ACA4>\u25A0</color>  Secondary alleys\n<color=#8A8680>\u25A0</color>  Small alleys\n<color=#141414>\u25A0</color>  Buildings\n<color=#FFD040>\u25A0</color>  District landmark\n<color=#C8A060>\u25A0</color>  Raised catwalks\n<color=#806040>\u25A0</color>  Scrap pit\n<color=#C0B8A8>\u25A0</color>  Gang territory (tinted)\n<color=#FFD173>\u25CF</color>  Your property\n<color=#FF7359>\u25A0</color>  For sale\n\u2500\u2500\u2500  District border\n\n\u25C6  You\n\n<color=#8A8680>M / Esc to close</color>"
